      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2>Get Involved</h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><span>A Sustainable Future has just gotten started, and we have faith that it will unfurl into a nationwide environmental initiative with people like you. Join us in taking the first step towards A Sustainable Future.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span><span>For position inquiries</span>, please fill out this Google Form: <span><a href=\"https://forms.gle/pSJntiZR7ovhoDeJ6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forms.gle/xqsedpkbSjx9ALQ36</a></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span>​</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span>For collaboration inquiries, </span>please contact: <span><a href=\"mailto:contact@asustainablefuture.org\" target=\"_self\">contact@asustainablefuture.org</a></span></span></p>"
    },
